<title>FINLAND: HK-RUOKATALO TO APPLY FOR BROKERS' LISTING H1 1997.</title>
<headline>HK-RUOKATALO TO APPLY FOR BROKERS' LISTING H1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group HK-Ruokatalo Oy, previously LSO-Foods Oy, said on Thursday it would apply for a listing on the Helsinki Brokers' list during the first half of 1997 and issue a 62.5 million markka convertible bond.</p>
<p>&quot;HK-Ruokatalo has decided to apply for listing for its A share on the Helsinki Brokers' list during the first half of 1997,&quot; HK-Ruokatalo said in a statement.</p>
</text>
